Fixed: The matrix-free local-smoothing GMG solver now supports rotated
periodicity in two-dimensional spherical-shell geometries with 90- and
180-degree opening angles. The level operators and geometric transfers use
the same rotated velocity constraints, while scalar pressure periodicity is
also applied on every multigrid level. These geometries now select GMG when
the Stokes solver type is left at its default value.
<br>
(Francesco Radica, 2026/07/30)
